@startuml
!include tema.puml
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Cliente / eventos sintéticos" as C
package "Núcleo implementado" {
 component "API síncrona" as S
 component "API produtora" as A
 queue "Kafka / eventos e DLQ" as K
 component "Consumidor / retry" as W
 component "Contrato + hash + repositório comum" as N
 database "PostgreSQL / audit_records" as D
 C --> S
 C --> A
 S --> N
 A --> K
 K --> W
 W --> N
 N --> D
}
rectangle "k6 + coleta de logs, offsets e recursos\nScripts e relatórios" as M
M ..> S
M ..> W
note bottom of M
 Protocolo científico definitivo requer calibração.
 Interfaces dedicadas: wireframes propostos.
end note
@enduml
